lox init: /project

Prerequisites
  !!  Docker does not answer: start Docker Desktop (open -a Docker), then run lox init again
  !!  cosign not found: install cosign: brew install cosign
  --  lea not found (the locks run without it; lockhttp needs it): install lea: curl -fsSL https://leadeck.dev/install.sh | sh
  ok  launchers: locksql, lockmq, lockfile, lockhttp, locklog, lockssh
